ottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 50 foizi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 102"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">yuridik shaxslar uchun yoki agar taraflardan biri yuridik shaxs boʻlsa</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 1 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 103"><td style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 97.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="97%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Izoh</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">. Notarial idora binosidan tashqarida amalga oshiriladigan notarial harakatlar uchun davlat boji ikki baravar miqdorda undiriladi, bundan fuqarolarning oʻzini oʻzi boshqarish organlari binolarida notariuslarning sayyor qabullari chogʻida amalga oshiriladigan notarial harakatlar, shuningdek ozodlikdan mahrum qilish joylaridagi yoki qamoqda saqlanayotgan shaxslarning ishonchnomalarini notarial tartibda tasdiqlash mustasno. </span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Nikoh shartnomasini va aliment toʻlash haqidagi bitimni notarial tartibda tasdiqlash, ularga oʻzgartishlar kiritish yoki ularni bekor qilish, shuningdek mol-mulkni oʻzga shaxsga oʻtkazishni taqiqlash va taqiqlashni bekor qilish chogʻida davlat boji undirilmaydi.</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 104"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">5. Fuqarolik holati dalolatnomalarini roʻyxatdan oʻtkazganlik, fuqarolarga fuqarolik holati dalolatnomalari roʻyxatdan oʻtkazilganligi toʻgʻrisida takroriy guvohnomalar berganlik, fuqarolik holati dalolatnomalariga oʻzgartishlar, tuzatishlar va qoʻshimchalar kiritganlik, fuqarolik holati dalolatnomalari yozuvlarini tiklaganlik, familiya, ism va ota ismini oʻzgartirganlik uchun </span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 105"><td style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">a) nikohni qayd etganlik uchun</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 20 foizi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 106"><td rowspan="4" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-l