5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">g) tugʻilganlik haqida, nikohni qayd etganlik, nikohni bekor qilganlik toʻgʻrisida, oʻlim haqidagi yozuvlar oʻzgartirilganligi, ularga qoʻshimchalar kiritilganligi, tuzatilganligi va qayta tiklanganligi munosabati bilan guvohnomalar berganlik uchun</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 10 foizi</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 114"><td style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">d) fuqarolik holati dalolatnomalarini qayd etilganlik haqida takroriy guvohnomalar berganlik uchun</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-to