rmal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Izoh. Nogironligi boʻlgan shaxslar, faxriylar, xotin-qizlar hamda bolalar jamoat birlashmalarini davlat roʻyxatidan oʻtkazish uchun davlat boji belgilangan stavkaning 50 foizi miqdorida undiriladi.</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 135"><td rowspan="8" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" width="3%"></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 97.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="97%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">b) Davlat xizmatlari markazlarida</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 136"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">chet el investitsiyalari ishtirokidagi korxonalar davlat roʻyxatidan oʻtkazilganda yoki qayta roʻyxatdan oʻtkazilganda</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 1 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 137"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Sugʻurtalovchilar (qayta sugʻurtalovchilar) va sugʻurta brokerlari, auditorlik tashkilotlari, soliq maslahatchilari tashkilotlari, birjalar, lombardlar, investitsiya fondlarini, “Oʻzbekoziqovqatzaxira” meva-sabzavot mahsulotlarini tayyorlash va gʻamlash korxonalari uyushmasi tarkibiga kiruvchi korxonalarni, bozorlarni, Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti va Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining tegishli qarorlari bilan aksiyadorlik jamiyatlari (shu jumladan xolding) shaklida tashkil etilayotgan xoʻjalik birlashmalari davlat roʻyxatidan oʻtkazilganda yoki qayta roʻyxatdan oʻtkazilganda</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 4 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 138;height: 56.25pt"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt;height: 56.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">yuridik shaxs boʻlgan tadbirkorlik subyektlarini, yuridik shaxs tashkil etmagan yakka tartibdagi tadbirkorlarni, yuridik shaxs tashkil etmagan oilaviy tadbirkorlik subyektlarini hamda yuridik shaxslar birlashmalari davlat roʻyxatidan oʻtkazilganda yoki qayta roʻyxatdan oʻtkazilganda</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt;height: 56.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 1 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 139"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25p