ar berganlik uchun davlat boji (patent boji) ekspertiza qarori joʻnatilgan sanadan eʼtiboran uch oy ichida toʻlanadi. Davlat boji (patent boji) ushbu muddat tugagan kundan eʼtiboran olti oy ichida toʻlangan taqdirda uning miqdori 50 foizga koʻpayadi.</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 575"><td rowspan="4" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td colspan="2" style="width: 97.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="97%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">v) integral mikrosxemalar topologiyasiga huquqlar oʻtkazish toʻgʻrisidagi shartnomalarni roʻyxatdan oʻtkazish uchun</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 576"><td colspan="2" style="width: 97.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 3.0pt 0cm 3.0pt" valign="top" width="97%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;text-align: justify;line-height: normal"><span lang="UZ-CYR" style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-ansi-language: UZ-CYR;mso-fareast-language: RU">integral mikrosxemalar topologiyasiga huquqlar oʻtkazish toʻgʻrisidagi shartnomani roʻyxatdan oʻtkazish</span></p></td></tr><tr