/span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 10 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 698"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">b) atom energiyasidan foydalanish va ionlashtiruvchi nurlanish manbalari muomalasi sohasidagi faoliyat</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 10 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 699"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">26. Faoliyatning ayrim turlarini Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati tomonidan litsenziyalaganlik uchun toʻlanadigan davlat boji</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 700"><td style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">axborotning kriptografik himoya vositalarini ishlab chiqish, ishlab chiqarish va realizatsiya qilish</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 5 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 701"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">27. Faoliyatning ayrim turlarini Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Turizmni rivojlantirish davlat qoʻmitasining hududiy boʻlinmalari tomonidan litsenziyalaganlik uchun toʻlanadigan davlat boji:</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 702"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">a) “ichki turizm” yoʻnalishi boʻyicha turizm faoliyati</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 2 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 703"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">b) “chiqish turizmi” yoki “kirish turizmi” yoʻnalishi boʻyicha turizm faoliyati yoxud bittadan ortiq yoʻnalish turi boʻyicha turizm faoliyatini amalga oshirish</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 5 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 704"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">28. Faoliyatning ayrim turlarini Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Din ishlari boʻyicha qoʻmitasi tomonidan litsenziyalaganlik uchun toʻlanadigan davlat boji:</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 705"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">a) diniy taʼlim muassasalarining faoliyati</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 10 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 706"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">b) “Umra” tadbirlarini tashkil etish va oʻtkazish boʻyicha faoliyat</span>