',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">“v”, “g” va “d” kichik bandlarda nazarda tutilgan litsenziyalarni oʻzgartirilganlik uchun mazkur kichik bandlarda belgilangan davlat bojlarining 50 foizi miqdorida davlat boji toʻlanadi.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em style="mso-bidi-font-style: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">“v”, “g” va “d” kichik bandlarda nazarda tutilgan litsenziyalarni qayta rasmiylashtirilganlik uchun BHMning 500 baravari miqdorida yigʻim undiriladi.</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 716"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">31. Faoliyatning ayrim turlarini Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Sogʻliqni saqlash vazirligi tomonidan litsenziyalaganlik uchun toʻlanadigan davlat boji:</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 717"><td rowspan="2" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p 