e="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">kk) teleradioeshittirishlarni tarqatish (namoyish qilish) tarmoqlarini qurish</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 10 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 786"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">ll) teleradioeshittirishlarni tarqatish (namoyish qilish) tarmoqlaridan foydalanish</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 75 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 787"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">mm) teleradioeshittirishlarni tarqatish (namoyish qilish) tarmoqlari xizmatlarini koʻrsatish</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 75 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 788"><td colspan="2" style="width: 97.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="97%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Izoh</span></em></strong><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">. Davlat bojining miqdori davlat boji toʻlangan kunda belgilangan bazaviy hisoblash miqdoriga koʻpaytirilgan miqdorda bir yillik miqdori hisobidan belgilangan. Davlat boji har yili belgilangan miqdorlarda toʻlanadi.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Navbatdagi yillik toʻlov litsenziyadan foydalanishning keyingi yili boshlanishidan kamida 30 kun oldin toʻlanadi, keyingi toʻlov belgilangan muddatda toʻlanmagan taqdirda, litsenziyaning amal qilishi toʻxtatib turiladi.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Respublikaning cheklangan hududida harakatlanadigan radiotelefon (uyali) aloqa sohasida faoliyatni amalga oshirish uchun litsenziya olingan taqdirda davlat boji miqdori qamrov hududidagi aholi soniga mutanosib ravishda har mingta yashovchiga BHMning 5,85 baravari hisobidan belgilanadi.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Agar uyali aloqa virtual operatori (provayder) tomonidan navbatdagi yillik davlat bojini toʻlash davridan oldingi moliya yili uchun koʻrsatilgan koʻchma radiotelefon (uyali) aloqa tarmoqlari xizmatlarining qiymati bazaviy hisoblash miqdorining 1,5 million baravaridan oshsa, “e<sup>1</sup>” kichik bandda nazarda tutilgan faoliyat turi uchun davlat bojining summasiga koʻrsatilgan koʻchma radiotelefon (uyali) aloqa tarmoqlari xizmatlari qiymatining 1 foizi miqdorida qoʻshimcha belgilanadi.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Uyali aloqa virtual operatori (provayder) tomonidan oʻtgan moliya yilida koʻrsatilgan koʻchma radiotelefon (uyali) aloqa tarmoqlari xizmatlarining qiymati qoʻshilgan qiymat soligʻi va aksiz soligʻi chegirib tashlangan holda aniqlanadi.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">Qishloq joylardagi aloqa va axborotlashtirish sohasi kichik tadbirkorlik subyektlariga:</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">qishloq joylarda 2048 dan ortiq raqamga ega boʻlgan mahalliy telekommunikatsiya tarmoqlaridan foydalanish boʻyicha faoliyatni amalga oshirishga ruxsat berilmaydi;</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">bir vaqtning oʻzida qishloq joylarda shaharlararo va mahalliy telekommunikatsiya tarmoqlariga xizmatlar koʻrsatish faoliyatini amalga oshirish huquqiga doir litsenziyalarni olishda mahalliy telekommunikatsiya tarmoqlariga xizmatlar koʻrsatish faoliyatini amalga oshirish huquqiga doir litsenziyani berish davlat boji toʻlamasdan amalga oshiriladi;</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">bir vaqtning oʻzida qishloq joylarda xalqaro, shaharlararo va mahalliy telekommunikatsiya tarmoqlariga xizmatlar koʻrsatish faoliyatini amalga oshirish huquqiga doir litsenziyalarni olishda shaharlararo va mahalliy telekommunikatsiya tarmoqlariga xizmatlar koʻrsatish faoliyatini amalga oshirish huquqiga doir litsenziyalarni berish davlat boji toʻlamasdan amalga oshiriladi.</span></em></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><em><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">“zz”, “ii”, “kk”, “ll”, “mm” kichik bandlarda nazarda tutilgan faoliyat turlari uchun navbatdagi har yilgi davlat bojini har chorak birinchi oyining 10-sanasiga qadar kelgusi chorak uchun teng ulushlarda boʻlib-boʻlib toʻlashga yoʻl qoʻyiladi.</span></em></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 789"><td colspan="3" style="width: 100.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="100%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><strong><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">37. Faoliyatning ayrim turlarini Oʻzbekiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Mahkamasi huzuridagi Elektr energiyasi, neft mahsulotlari va gazdan foydalanishni nazorat qilish inspeksiyasi tomonidan litsenziyalaganlik uchun toʻlanadigan davlat boji:</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 790"><td rowspan="3" style="width: 3.0%;border: solid black 1.0pt;border-top: none;mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="3%"></td><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">neft, gazni (shu jumladan siqilgan tabiiy va suyultirilgan uglevodorod gazini) va gaz kondensatini qazib olish, qayta ishlash hamda realizatsiya qilish</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="39%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">BHMning 10 baravari</span></p></td></tr><tr style="mso-yfti-irow: 791"><td style="width: 58.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-right-alt: solid black .75pt;padding: 0cm 5.25pt 0cm 5.25pt" valign="top" width="58%"><p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;line-height: normal"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt;font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-language: RU">magistral gaz quvurlarini, neft quvurlarini va neft mahsulotlari quvurlarini loyihalashtirish, qurish, ulardan foydalanish hamda ularni taʼmirlash</span></p></td><td style="width: 39.0%;border-top: none;border-left: none;border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt;border-right: solid black 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .75pt;mso-border-r